// oracle (produced 2026-10-30 in the hicx-ref-3.7.6 environment). The tests pin
// the tie handling: lowest index among equal nearest neighbours, predecessor
// preferred, merged cluster in the higher slot, stable ordering by height.
// Floats are C hex literals so that they are exact.

